  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>In your hands, all lances count as magic weapons and deal +2 additional Damage while mounted and Charging. They also lose the Improvised Weapon effect if used on a round you haven&rsquo;t Charged, while mounted. If you wield a lance that is already magical, its Damage is increased by +1.</p>\n<p><strong>Grail Virtue :</strong> You gain a permanent +5 bonus to your Strength and Toughness Characteristics this does not count towards your Advances; moreover, you gain the @Compendium[wfrp4e-core.items.SfUUdOGjdYpr3KSR]{Regenerate} Trait and the @Compendium[wfrp4e-core.items.3wCtgMDNnu8MFmyk]{Immunity (Corruption, Disease, Fatigue, Poison)} Trait.</p>"
    },
